{
 "item": "e23",
 "show": "dbza",
 "youtube": "ctd84NLgTxw",
 "title": "Episode 21",
 "duration": 579,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 6.96,
   "end": 8.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Yes best time!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 9.1,
   "end": 11.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Finally! I'm on Planet Namek."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 11.58,
   "end": 13.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "HELP UUU-UU-UUS!"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 13.4,
   "end": 15.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "So *serene*..."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 15.26,
   "end": 18.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "OH GOD, HE'S KILLING US! HE-E-ELP!"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 18.0,
   "end": 24.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I think I hear a duck... but this far out in space? That doesn't make any sense!"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 24.52,
   "end": 25.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "QUAAAACK!"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 25.88,
   "end": 28.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh, no! That sounds like Krillin!"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 28.14,
   "end": 29.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I'ma COMIN'!"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 30.6,
   "end": 34.26,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"Sanjō!! Ginyū Tokusentai!!\" ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 34.26,
   "end": 37.08,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Eriito Senshi - Ginyū Tokusentai!"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 37.94,
   "end": 42.3,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ Tokusentai! ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 44.94,
   "end": 49.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Announcer",
   "text": "\"Kono bangumi wa TeamFourStar Soda to goran no suponsaa no teikyou de okurishimasu.\" (This program is brought to you by TeamFourStar Soda and the following sponsors.)"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 51.7,
   "end": 56.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I can't believe we came all the way out here and spent a week in the space boonies for nothing!"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 56.36,
   "end": 62.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Seriously, I'm surprised that we didn't hear banjos on the way in, because everybody's inbred AND LOOKS THE F***ING SAME!"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 62.6,
   "end": 72.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Not to mention I lost Dodoria *and* Zarbon, the latter of whom spent 400 credits making long distance calls to his girlfriend, WHO I AM CONVINCED IS NAMED CHUCK!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 72.16,
   "end": 73.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Captain Ginyu",
   "text": "Lord Freeza?"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 73.06,
   "end": 74.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "WHAT!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 74.02,
   "end": 76.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Captain Ginyu",
   "text": "There may be still be a few holed up somewhere."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 76.38,
   "end": 78.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Captain Ginyu",
   "text": "Perhaps you should check your Scouter!"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 79.34,
   "end": 80.6,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Various Scouter beeps"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 80.72,
   "end": 83.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Well, would you look at that. Three in that direction!"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 83.4,
   "end": 84.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Good work, Ginyu."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 84.36,
   "end": 85.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Captain Ginyu",
   "text": "All in a day's work, sir."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 88.9,
   "end": 91.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Captain Ginyu",
   "text": "And now... The Dance of Solitude!"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 91.94,
   "end": 94.1,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"Vogue\" ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 95.36,
   "end": 97.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "So, are we just waiting for this thing or wha--?"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 99.12,
   "end": 100.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "'OLY DOOLIE!"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 100.06,
   "end": 101.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "JESUS, THAT WAS *FAST*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 102.02,
   "end": 108.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "I-I-I mean not as... not as fast as me, considering I'm the fastest in the... i-in the Universe..."
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 108.12,
   "end": 110.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "...but compared to the average person--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 110.1,
   "end": 111.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "We get it, mate. It's cool."
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 111.78,
   "end": 112.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Gohan!"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 112.28,
   "end": 113.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey, Gohan!"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 113.5,
   "end": 114.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Gohan!"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 114.8,
   "end": 115.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Gohan?"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 116.16,
   "end": 118.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Maybe he'll wake up if I shake him some more..."
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 118.34,
   "end": 120.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "GOKU! JUST GIVE HIM A SENZU!"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 120.14,
   "end": 122.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "OH, right! Eat up Gohan!"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 122.1,
   "end": 125.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Recoome",
   "text": "HEY! Recoome was in the middle of a match here!"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 125.1,
   "end": 125.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Recoome",
   "text": "So how about you--"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 125.98,
   "end": 129.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Sir? I am *talking*... to my *son*."
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 129.28,
   "end": 130.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Recoome",
   "text": "Oh; Recoome apologizes."
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 131.32,
   "end": 135.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Recoome",
   "text": "...Wait, what am I apologizing for?! RECOOME'S GONNA KILL YOU!"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 136.2,
   "end": 137.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Dad?"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 137.16,
   "end": 137.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "DAD!"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 137.88,
   "end": 141.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Oh my God, you're here! I love you, Dad!"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 141.38,
   "end": 143.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "That's right, Gohan. I *am* here!"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 144.36,
   "end": 146.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey, Krillin! Ya hanging in there?"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 146.34,
   "end": 150.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Oh! I've had worse. You know, when I died..."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 150.42,
   "end": 152.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "This is definitely a close second though...."
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 152.12,
   "end": 154.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Recoome",
   "text": "RECOOME WILL NOT BE IGNORED!"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 154.58,
   "end": 158.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "SIR! I am *trying* to talk to my friends!"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 158.06,
   "end": 159.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey Vegeta, we're friends now, right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 159.7,
   "end": 160.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "F*** off."
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 160.32,
   "end": 162.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "The best! Now have a magic bean!"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 163.12,
   "end": 167.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "But make sure you chew it, or else you'll grow a beanstalk in your belly!"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 167.36,
   "end": 177.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Goku, it was terrible! We landed here, and then there were these really strong guys, and there was even more strong guys, AND THEN OUR SHIP BLEW UP, AND THEN THERE WAS *EVEN MORE STR*--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 177.3,
   "end": 178.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Bored now! Reading your mind!"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 178.62,
   "end": 179.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Wait wha--?"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 183.18,
   "end": 185.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Haha! That thing was a guy!"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 185.74,
   "end": 187.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Goku, did you just read my mind...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 187.4,
   "end": 188.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Yuh-huh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 188.02,
   "end": 188.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "But how could you--??"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 188.74,
   "end": 189.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Muffin Button."
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 190.12,
   "end": 190.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "...What?"
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 190.12,
   "end": 190.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 191.12,
   "end": 194.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Recoome",
   "text": "*THAT'S*! *IT*! Recoome has had enough!"
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 194.7,
   "end": 201.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Recoome",
   "text": "Feel the strength of the REEEEEECOOME... ULTRA FIGHTING MIRACLE--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 201.74,
   "end": 202.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "SIR!"
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 202.26,
   "end": 203.18,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THWACK"
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 204.88,
   "end": 206.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I will fight you in a minute."
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 207.0,
   "end": 209.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'This... This is impossible...!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 209.42,
   "end": 213.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'Kakarot was nowhere NEAR that same level when we fought on Earth!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 213.02,
   "end": 216.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'The only way he could've obtained this strength, is...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 216.0,
   "end": 217.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "No... it can't be...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 217.94,
   "end": 221.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "The legend says it only happens every 1,000 YEARS!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 221.58,
   "end": 224.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Has he become... a SUPER SAIYAN?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 225.22,
   "end": 228.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "So, anyway Vegeta, what happened to you?"
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 228.16,
   "end": 229.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Did you get beat up by this guy?"
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 229.64,
   "end": 231.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Recoome",
   "text": "(Gurgling)"
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 231.1,
   "end": 234.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ahh, n-no! I, ummm... uhhh--"
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 234.5,
   "end": 236.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Ghost Nappa",
   "text": "You fell down some stairs."
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 236.02,
   "end": 237.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I fell down some stairs."
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 237.62,
   "end": 238.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "No you didn't, you--"
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 238.5,
   "end": 240.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Shut up before I throw you down a flight."
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 242.54,
   "end": 244.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "So, Dende..."
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 245.56,
   "end": 247.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "sucks about your family--"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 247.26,
   "end": 248.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "We've gone over this....."
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 248.48,
   "end": 251.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "But do you know who also lost his family?"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 252.48,
   "end": 253.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Batman."
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 253.4,
   "end": 255.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "I don't know who that is..."
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 255.48,
   "end": 258.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "See!? This is why we need TVEEE!"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 258.88,
   "end": 259.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "Why?"
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 259.5,
   "end": 263.02,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Loosely singing to the rhythm of the Batman theme (1966)"
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 259.5,
   "end": 266.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "♪ Nananananananana Dende! ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 267.44,
   "end": 268.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "♪ Dende! ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 268.98,
   "end": 269.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "Guru--"
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 269.56,
   "end": 271.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "♪ Dende! ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 271.04,
   "end": 271.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "Nail's here..."
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 271.7,
   "end": 274.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "♪ Naaaaaaaaaaillll! ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 274.76,
   "end": 276.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "♪ Why are you back? ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 276.56,
   "end": 280.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Nail",
   "text": "I never left, sir. I was outside hitting my head against the wall for 20 minutes."
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 280.78,
   "end": 281.28,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Flashback"
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 281.28,
   "end": 282.12,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THUMP"
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 281.28,
   "end": 282.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Nail",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 282.12,
   "end": 282.94,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THUMP THUMP"
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 282.12,
   "end": 282.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Nail",
   "text": "Ugh! Unh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "start": 282.94,
   "end": 283.8,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THUMP THUMP THUMP"
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 282.94,
   "end": 283.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Nail",
   "text": "Ugh! Unh! Unh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 283.8,
