   "start": 284.3,
   "end": 286.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "So that's what that was..."
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 287.1,
   "end": 289.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Why have you ignored my order?"
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 289.5,
   "end": 293.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Nail",
   "text": "*Because*, Lord Guru, I can't leave you unguarded, no matter--"
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 293.38,
   "end": 294.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "TUWAHHG!"
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 295.22,
   "end": 296.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "CLEAN THAT UP!"
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 297.12,
   "end": 298.58,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Batman transition"
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 298.7,
   "end": 300.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "What the *bleedin'* 'ell?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 300.48,
   "end": 306.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "We were havin' a right rip snorter 'ere, and then this piker shows up, and just like that, it's Goodnight Irene!"
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 306.78,
   "end": 309.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "We *get it*, you're from Space Australia!"
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 310.389,
   "end": 314.329,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Alright, you bastard! Prepare to feel the wrath of the GINYU--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 314.329,
   "end": 314.929,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THWACK"
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 314.329,
   "end": 314.929,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "GUOGH!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 315.129,
   "end": 318.089,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "D'AAUGH! You *goddamn wanker*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 318.089,
   "end": 319.249,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "You punched me in the--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 319.249,
   "end": 320.049,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THWACK"
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 319.249,
   "end": 320.049,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "D'UOGH!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 320.049,
   "end": 321.629,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "D'AUGH! You did it again!"
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 321.889,
   "end": 322.489,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THWACK"
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 321.889,
   "end": 322.489,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "D-- D'AGH!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 322.709,
   "end": 323.989,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "STOP IT! STOP I--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 323.989,
   "end": 324.609,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THWACK"
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 323.989,
   "end": 324.609,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "DU--!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 324.609,
   "end": 325.509,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "*PIIIISS*!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 325.789,
   "end": 329.229,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "'Auugh, what did the Cap'n tell us to do in this situation?!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 329.629,
   "end": 333.989,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Captain Ginyu",
   "text": "Jeice, if you ever find yourself being punched repeatedly in the face, always remember to--"
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 333.989,
   "end": 334.509,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THWACK"
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 333.989,
   "end": 334.509,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "D'OHH!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 334.509,
   "end": 336.829,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "OWW, HE CUT OFF THE CAP'N!"
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 336.829,
   "end": 339.509,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "So... are you gonna *dodge* any of these?"
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 339.509,
   "end": 342.229,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Ohhhh, THAT'S what the Captain--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 342.229,
   "end": 343.309,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THWACK"
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 342.229,
   "end": 343.309,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "(Wailing)"
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 343.309,
   "end": 345.269,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "*BURTER*!! *SUPPORT*!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 345.269,
   "end": 351.969,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Well, you've got very nice hair, you're a beautiful shade of red, and honestly, you're the only guy I can rely on on this team."
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 351.969,
   "end": 355.569,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "AH MEANT *PUNCH HIM*, YA DAFT BASTARD!! Ugh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 355.569,
   "end": 356.249,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "(Inhaling)"
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 356.249,
   "end": 359.129,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Oh, but, thanks ya know? Th-that really cheered me--"
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 359.129,
   "end": 359.829,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "THWACK"
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 359.129,
   "end": 362.229,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "OHH... GOD, I THINK HE BROKE SOMETHING THAT TIME!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 362.349,
   "end": 362.849,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "YEGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 364.089,
   "end": 366.429,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"U Can't Touch This\" ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 366.429,
   "end": 367.249,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Goku Time!"
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 367.249,
   "end": 368.109,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "OHHWW!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 370.129,
   "end": 372.629,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Alright - this is just bloody stupid!"
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 372.629,
   "end": 375.089,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Calm down! We gotta come up with a plan."
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 375.229,
   "end": 380.049,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Listen - if you use your Crusher Ball on him, I can rush him the moment he tries to dodge."
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 380.049,
   "end": 384.249,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "He may be fast, but he's not faster than the fastest guy in the Universe!"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 384.249,
   "end": 388.869,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "OK. Mate, we need to talk... About this whole... \"Fastest in the Universe\" thing..."
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 389.269,
   "end": 391.989,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "First off, the Captain's got a higher power level than you."
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 391.989,
   "end": 392.949,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Yeah, so?"
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 392.949,
   "end": 397.289,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Well then, correct me if I'm wrong, but a higher power level means he's faster, yeah?"
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 397.289,
   "end": 398.729,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Well, okay, maybe--"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 398.729,
   "end": 401.789,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "And Lord Freeza's got a higher power level than all of us..."
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 401.789,
   "end": 403.569,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "OK, that's just not fair!"
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 403.569,
   "end": 406.689,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "*And*, if you think about it, Guldo can stop time!"
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 405.609,
   "end": 406.689,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Hurrh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 406.689,
   "end": 408.409,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "So that technically makes him faster than--"
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 408.409,
   "end": 413.449,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "*NO*!! NO! NO, OKAY?! I am not! Slower! Than f***ing *GULDO*!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 413.449,
   "end": 414.569,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Burter, calm down!"
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 414.569,
   "end": 417.789,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "NO! SHUT UP!! You shut your stupid red face!"
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 417.789,
   "end": 421.069,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "\"Oh, don't worry mate, you're just slower than Guldo!\""
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 421.069,
   "end": 422.669,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "I don't want to hear it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 421.069,
   "end": 423.669,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "'I wonder if there is a Denny's on this planet...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 422.669,
   "end": 424.949,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "You! Don't! Get it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 423.669,
   "end": 425.969,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "'I could really go for a Grand Slam!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 424.949,
   "end": 426.769,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "You don't know what it's like!"
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 426.769,
   "end": 430.049,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Everyone has something special! I don't!"
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 430.049,
   "end": 435.009,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "What am I?! The big blue snake guy! That's all I've got!"
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 435.009,
   "end": 438.289,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "That's all I've go-oo-ooot...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 438.289,
   "end": 441.929,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Geez, mate, I'm-I'm sorry. I didn't mean to hurt your feelings..."
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 441.929,
   "end": 444.509,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "I just... I just want to be special!"
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 444.509,
   "end": 446.229,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Something to call my own, you know?"
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 446.229,
   "end": 449.269,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Mate, mate, you DO got something special!"
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 449.569,
   "end": 450.529,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "You're me mate."
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 450.529,
   "end": 451.729,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Aww, dude!"
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 451.729,
   "end": 452.949,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "No, no, really!"
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 452.949,
   "end": 455.749,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Remember when I had to move me piano into me flat?"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 455.749,
   "end": 464.409,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "And Recoome was too busy with his match? And Guldo... well, he was Guldo, BUT YOU! YOU got those ivory keys up those five flights in no time at all!"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 464.409,
   "end": 465.849,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "You're me best mate!"
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 465.849,
   "end": 468.769,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "Thanks, Jeice! You're my best friend too!"
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 469.169,
   "end": 475.669,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "You know? After all this is over, what do you say we head off to Spacey's and just... have a good old time?"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 475.669,
   "end": 477.429,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Sounds good, mate!"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 477.429,
   "end": 480.829,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "But remember, you still owe me that space soda!"
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 480.829,
   "end": 482.949,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "HAHA! You're right I do!"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 482.949,
   "end": 485.429,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "Now! Let's go show that bloke what for--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 485.649,
   "end": 486.569,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Burter",
   "text": "GAH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "start": 486.569,
   "end": 487.309,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Brutal impact"
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "start": 488.669,
   "end": 491.129,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Say, do you know where there is a Denny's around here?"
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "start": 491.229,
   "end": 493.429,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "BURTER!!! NOOOO!!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 202,
   "start": 493.429,
   "end": 496.309,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Butter! That'll go GREAT on my Grand Slam!"
  },
  {
   "i": 203,
   "start": 496.469,
   "end": 498.449,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "You just killed me best mate!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 204,
   "start": 498.769,
   "end": 503.689,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "I'm... I'm gonna get the Cap'n, and he's gonna BEAT YOU UP!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 205,
   "start": 503.989,
   "end": 506.409,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Jeice",
   "text": "CAAAAPTAAAAAAAIN...!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 206,
   "start": 506.829,
   "end": 509.849,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Well, that was fun. Now where are the fighters?"
  },
  {
   "i": 207,
   "start": 509.849,
   "end": 512.189,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I really wanna deck that Freezer guy!"
  },
  {
   "i": 208,
   "start": 512.489,
   "end": 514.109,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You've got to be kidding."
  },
  {
   "i": 209,
   "start": 514.109,
   "end": 515.929,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "*This* is a Super Saiyan??"
  },
  {
   "i": 210,
   "start": 515.929,
   "end": 517.049,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "A Super wha...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 211,
   "start": 517.049,
   "end": 520.069,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Nothing, just... lamenting my crushed dreams."
  },
  {
   "i": 212,
   "start": 520.069,
   "end": 522.749,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Goku! I can't believe you're so strong!"
  },
  {
   "i": 213,
   "start": 522.749,
   "end": 525.829,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Well, I did train at 100x normal gravity."
  },
  {
   "i": 214,
   "start": 526.529,
   "end": 527.029,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "FU--!!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 215,
   "start": 527.029,
   "end": 527.769,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "900Hz sine wave tone"
  },
  {
   "i": 216,
   "start": 527.769,
   "end": 529.929,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Man, no *wonder* you killed them so easily!"
  },
  {
   "i": 217,
   "start": 527.769,
   "end": 529.929,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "900Hz sine wave tone"
  },
  {
   "i": 218,
   "start": 529.929,
   "end": 530.429,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "--CK!"
  },
  {
   "i": 219,
   "start": 530.969,
   "end": 532.729,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Krillin, I'm not gonna kill them!"
  },
